      <Text-field alignment="left" style="Maple Input" layout="Normal" xml:space="preserve"># 4b. Independently check the reflection action on the kernel.
# Each V column has real polynomial entries. Reflection reverses tensor order,
# followed by complex conjugation of coefficients; conjugation fixes these entries.
