          "nonvanishing change of two kernel equations"):
gN := expand(normal(((3-N)*kernelCap+(N-2)*kernelDoubleMerge)/deltaGH)):
hN := expand(normal((-(N^2-4*N+2)*kernelCap+N*kernelDoubleMerge)/deltaGH)):
